#: src/rsiwidget.cpp:78
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>Welcome to RSIBreak</p>\n"
"<p>In your tray you can now see RSIBreak.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Dobro došli u RSIBreak</p>\n"
"<p>RSIBreak sada možete vidjeti u programskoj traci.</p>\n"

#: src/rsiwidget.cpp:80
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"<p>When you right-click on that you will see a menu, from which you can go "
"to the configuration for example.</p>\n"
"<p>When you want to know when the next break is, hover over the icon.</p>\n"
"<p>Use RSIBreak wisely.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Desnim klikom na njega otvorit će se izbornik iz kojeg možete, "
"primjerice, otvoriti postavke.</p>\n"
"<p>Da biste saznali kada je sljedeća stanka, zadržite pokazivač iznad "
"ikone.</p>\n"
"<p>Koristite RSIBreak razumno.</p>"

#: src/rsiwidget.cpp:84
#, kde-format
msgid "Welcome"
msgstr "Dobro došli"

#: src/setup.cpp:40
#, kde-format
msgid "General Settings"
msgstr "Opće postavke"

#: src/setup.cpp:44
#, kde-format
msgid "Timings"
msgstr "Vremenski razmaci"

#: src/setup.cpp:48
#, kde-format
msgid "During Breaks"
msgstr "Tijekom stanki"

#: src/setup.cpp:52
#, kde-format
msgid "Actions"
msgstr "Radnje"

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:38
#, kde-format
msgid "&Automatically start RSIBreak at startup"
msgstr "&Automatski pokreni RSIBreak pri pokretanju sustava"

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:40
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"With this option you can indicate that you want RSIBreak to start on Desktop "
"Environment start."
msgstr ""
"Ovom opcijom možete odrediti želite li da se RSIBreak pokrene pri pokretanju "
"radnog okruženja."

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:43
#, kde-format
msgid "Timer Settings"
msgstr "Postavke odbrojavanja"

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:44
#, kde-format
msgid "Break at &fixed times"
msgstr "Stanke u &fiksnim razmacima"

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:46
#, kde-format
msgid "With this option you indicate that you want to break at fixed intervals"
msgstr "Ovom opcijom određujete želite li stanke u fiksnim razmacima."

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:48
#, kde-format
msgid "Take activity into account"
msgstr "Uzimaj u obzir aktivnost"

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:50
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"With this option you indicate that you want to use idle detection. This "
"means that only the time you are active (when you use the keyboard or the "
"mouse) will be counted to calculate when to break next."
msgstr ""
"Ovom opcijom određujete želite li koristiti prepoznavanje neaktivnosti. "
"To znači da će se pri izračunu vremena do sljedeće stanke računati samo "
"vrijeme tijekom kojeg ste aktivni (koristite tipkovnicu ili miš)."

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:60
#, kde-format
msgid "&Suppress if fullscreen windows present"
msgstr "&Potisni kad su prisutni prozori preko cijelog zaslona"

#: src/setupgeneral.cpp:62
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"With this option you can indicate that you do not want RSIBreak to interfere "
"with presentations, games, video playback, and any other fullscreen "
"application on the current virtual desktop."
msgstr ""
"Ovom opcijom možete odrediti da RSIBreak ne ometa prezentacije, igre, "
"reprodukciju videozapisa ni druge aplikacije preko cijelog zaslona na "
"trenutačnoj virtualnoj radnoj površini."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:77
#, kde-format
msgid "Simple Gray Effect"
msgstr "Jednostavni sivi efekt"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:79
#, kde-format
msgid "Complete Black Effect"
msgstr "Potpuno crni efekt"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:80
#, kde-format
msgid "Show Plasma Dashboard"
msgstr "Prikaži nadzornu ploču Plasme"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:81
#, kde-format
msgid "Show Slide Show of Images"
msgstr "Prikaži dijaprojekciju slika"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:82
#, kde-format
msgid "Show a Passive Popup"
msgstr "Prikaži pasivni skočni prozor"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:89
#, kde-format
msgid "Skipping Breaks"
msgstr "Preskakanje stanki"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:91
#, kde-format
msgid "&Hide skip button"
msgstr "&Sakrij gumb za preskakanje"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:93
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check this option to disable and hide the skip button. This way you can "
"prevent skipping the break."
msgstr ""
"Označite ovu opciju da biste onemogućili i sakrili gumb za preskakanje. "
"Tako možete spriječiti preskakanje stanke."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:96
#, kde-format
msgid "&Hide lock button"
msgstr "&Sakrij gumb za zaključavanje"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:98
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check this option to disable and hide the lock button. This way you can "
"prevent pressing the wrong button."
msgstr ""
"Označite ovu opciju da biste onemogućili i sakrili gumb za zaključavanje. "
"Tako možete spriječiti pritiskanje pogrešnog gumba."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:100
#, kde-format
msgid "&Hide postpone button"
msgstr "&Sakrij gumb za odgodu"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:102
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Check this option to disable and hide the postpone break button. This way "
"you can prevent pressing the wrong button."
msgstr ""
"Označite ovu opciju da biste onemogućili i sakrili gumb za odgodu stanke. "
"Tako možete spriječiti pritiskanje pogrešnog gumba."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:105
#, kde-format
msgid "&Disable shortcut (Esc)"
msgstr "&Onemogući prečac (Esc)"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:107
#, kde-format
msgid "Check this option to disable the ESC key skipping the break."
msgstr "Označite ovu opciju da biste onemogućili preskakanje stanke tipkom Esc."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:120
#, kde-format
msgid "Plasma Dashboard"
msgstr "Nadzorna ploča Plasme"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:122
#, kde-format
msgid "Read Only"
msgstr "Samo za čitanje"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:130
#, kde-format
msgid "Transparency level"
msgstr "Razina prozirnosti"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:136
#, kde-format
msgid "Transparent"
msgstr "Prozirno"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:146
#, kde-format
msgid "Solid"
msgstr "Puno"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:155
#, kde-format
msgid "Slideshow"
msgstr "Dijaprojekcija"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:162
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"Select the folder from which you want to see images. These images are "
"randomly shown during the breaks. It will be searched recursively if you "
"want..."
msgstr ""
"Odaberite mapu iz koje želite prikazivati slike. Te se slike nasumično "
"prikazuju tijekom stanki. Po želji će se pretraživati i podmape..."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:165
#, kde-format
msgid "&Change..."
msgstr "&Promijeni..."

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:168
#, kde-format
msgid "Search path recursively"
msgstr "Rekurzivno pretraži putanju"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:169
#, kde-format
msgid "Show small images"
msgstr "Prikaži male slike"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:170
#, kde-format
msgid "Expand image to full screen"
msgstr "Proširi sliku preko cijelog zaslona"

#: src/setupmaximized.cpp:172
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"If checked then image will be expanded to full screen. Part of the image "
"outside the screen area will be cropped. Otherwise the image will be "
"displayed completely but there may grey areas around it. "
msgstr ""
"Ako je označeno, slika će se proširiti preko cijelog zaslona. Dio slike "
"izvan područja zaslona bit će izrezan. U suprotnom će se prikazati cijela "
